          > 3.7                A
          > 3.3                A-
          > 3.0                B+
          > 2.7                B
          > 2.3                B-
          > 2.0                C+
          > 1.7                C
          > 1.3                C-
          > 1.0                D+
          > 0.7                D
          > 0.0                D-
            0.0                E


